            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Ariztia Leniz, V. (2023). Fast decarbonization in a cost-based wholesale power framework: the case of Chile. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/gw529wt5354. https://doi.org/10.25740/gw529wt5354.",
            "type": "preferred citation",
